                        "sense_id": "9a626a68-0fbd-3d1c-857f-73bb957a96a2",
                        "entry_id": "33146fdd-9417-3b00-9307-4c0fbd3d8371",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à l’artérite."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77100f40-78c4-41b7-b2db-ff2e0d95a915",
                                "sense_id": "9a626a68-0fbd-3d1c-857f-73bb957a96a2",
                                "text": "En 1934 et 1955, je crois, on a isolé la vincamine, le principe actif de notre pervenche, et on s’en sert bel et bien pour vaincre la sclérose cérébrale, les troubles de la mémoire, la difficulté de concentration, la diminution des facultés intellectuelles des vieillards, bref le gâtisme et bien d’autres choses comme l’insuffisance coronarienne, les syndromes artéritiques, que sais-je encore ?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4891dd16-f533-4efe-b146-3fc4c131df8c",
                        "source_entry_id": "33146fdd-9417-3b00-9307-4c0fbd3d8371",
                        "source_sense_id": "9a626a68-0fbd-3d1c-857f-73bb957a96a2",
                        "target_lang_word": "arteritic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "arteritic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bbcff753-bb96-3789-9dd3-431879a87e32",
                                        "entry_id": "ba335b1d-73a7-3644-a7fb-41b4ecf37406",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to arteritis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a5fee86-f7fd-43c7-9de6-9360f7fe4785",
                                                "sense_id": "bbcff753-bb96-3789-9dd3-431879a87e32",
                                                "text": "We can fairly reconcile this apparent lapse by observing, that M. Nelaton confounds the arteritic form of the affection with that supervening on ossified arteries; a circumstance first noticed by Cowper, the anatomist, but denied gravely by Pott, an author who is frequently quoted as countenancing the idea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ae75460-8d78-4b78-b35f-663f43008882",
                                                "sense_id": "bbcff753-bb96-3789-9dd3-431879a87e32",
                                                "text": "These arteritic lesions are not confined to the striated musculature, but occur everywhere, including the superior and inferior mesenteric arterial beds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06a70a8d-603a-4520-a6fe-0f9bae0c2ef6",
                                                "sense_id": "bbcff753-bb96-3789-9dd3-431879a87e32",
                                                "text": "Arteritic and nonarteritic anterior ischemic optic neuropathy both manifest as sudden visual loss associated with optic disc edema."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
